:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AgUUkRliv8c9pnbRPR0Y08D6lJ6.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvUGF0cmljay1NZWxyb3NlLSUyOFRWLU1pbmktU2VyaWVzLTIwMTglMjktNzIwcC8.1.3","title":"Some Hope","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2018-05-26T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"England, 1990. Patrick Melrose, now 31, is finally clean and practicing law. Despite avoiding social situations and their inevitable temptations, Patrick is persuaded to attend a high society event in the Cotswolds by best friend Johnny.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/u961HexZbibqgRGQSiV0uSDIR2M.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvUGF0cmljay1NZWxyb3NlLSUyOFRWLU1pbmktU2VyaWVzLTIwMTglMjktNzIwcC8.1.4","title":"Mother's Milk","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2018-06-02T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"France, 2003. Patrick, 44, is now married to Mary, with sons Robert and Thomas. Patrick may be off the heroin, but is back tackling his troubles with substance abuse.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1upMzhv5dUHhgfJRHO0nMGZeaj.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvUGF0cmljay1NZWxyb3NlLSUyOFRWLU1pbmktU2VyaWVzLTIwMTglMjktNzIwcC8.1.5","title":"At Last","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2018-06-09T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"London, 2005. Having always dreamed of being an orphan, Patrick now has his wish at the age of 46. No longer with Mary, Patrick is clean and living alone in a grim bedsit.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jsrT2yLRmGiI1qeLQzPdbnRjgUt.jpg"}]}}